        <!-- ===================== LEGEND ===================== -->
        <mxCell id="legend-bg" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.rect;fillColor2=none;strokeWidth=1;size=20;indent=5;fillColor=light-dark(#EDF3FF,#305363);strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2180" y="150" width="700" height="1800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-title" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#FFFFFF);" value="Data Flow" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="170" width="400" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s1-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="212" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Load the app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;CloudFront serves the static export over HTTPS from a private S3 bucket, fetched with an OAC-signed SigV4 request - the bucket blocks all public access. A viewer-request function rewrites /login/ to login/index.html. Terraform syncs out/ and invalidates /* on apply.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="210" width="600" height="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s2-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="2" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="298" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Sign in&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Amplify signIn against the Cognito user pool through its public SPA client (no secret). Demo logins are seeded from tfvars; the pool's issuer and client id are what the API's JWT authorizer trusts (red dashed).&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="296" width="600" height="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s3-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="3" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="384" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Ask for an upload URL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;POST /api/upload-url carrying the ID token. AppApiLambda mints an 8-hex app_uuid and presigns a PUT for zipped/{uuid}.zip, valid 5 minutes. The presign is signed locally, so it needs no S3 call.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="382" width="600" height="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s4-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="4" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="470" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Upload&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The browser PUTs the zip straight to S3 with that URL - no auth header, the signature is the auth. It must be SigV4 or the SSE-KMS bucket rejects it 403, and the bucket's CORS rule must list the origin. 20MB cap, enforced in the browser and again in UnzipLambda.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="468" width="600" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s5-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="5" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="570" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Emit event&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The bucket notification (eventbridge = true) sends an Object Created event to EventBridge.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="568" width="600" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s6-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="6" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="636" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Start execution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;An EventBridge rule matching the wildcard zipped/*.zip calls states:StartExecution. That filter is what keeps the unzipped/ writes from re-triggering the pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="634" width="600" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s7-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="7" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="712" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Unzip&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;UnzipLambda extracts the archive back into unzipped/ and returns {app_uuid}, nested under $.application by ResultPath.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="710" width="600" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s8-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="8" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="778" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Persist metadata&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;WriteToDynamoLambda reads details.csv and put_item's the row into CustomerMetadataTable, keyed on APP_UUID. Its result lands at $.validation.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="776" width="600" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s9-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="9" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="844" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Parallel checks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The Parallel state runs both comparison Lambdas concurrently and collects them at $.parallelResults. Either branch raising aborts its sibling and fails the state.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="842" width="600" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s10-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="10" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="920" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s10-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Face match&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Rekognition CompareFaces checks the selfie against the license (SimilarityThreshold 80), writes LICENSE_SELFIE_MATCH, then raises on a non-match.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="918" width="600" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s11-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="11" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="996" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s11-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Detail match&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Textract AnalyzeID reads the license fields and compares them to the CSV after normalising case, spacing and date format, writes LICENSE_DETAILS_MATCH, then raises on a mismatch.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="994" width="600" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s12-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="12" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="1072" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s12-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Hand off to queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Only if both branches pass, the sqs:sendMessage service integration puts {driver_license_id, validation_override, uuid} on LicenseQueue.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="1070" width="600" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s13-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="13" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="1138" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s13-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Poll the queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;SubmitLicenseLambda polls LicenseQueue through an event source mapping (batch_size 1). The handler re-raises on error, which is the only reason a failure ever reaches the DLQ - a normal return would delete the message.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="1136" width="600" height="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s14-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="1224" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s14-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Validate and record&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;SubmitLicenseLambda SigV4-signs the payload (botocore SigV4Auth, signing name execute-api) and POSTs /license. That route is authorization_type = AWS_IAM, so an unsigned call 403s; API Gateway AWS_PROXY-invokes the mock ValidateLicenseLambda, then LICENSE_VALIDATION is written back to the table.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="1222" width="600" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s15-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="15" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="1330" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s15-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Poll the verdict&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Meanwhile the SPA polls GET /api/status/{uuid} on the same API. AppApiLambda get_item's the row and answers pending until all three flags exist - except that any flag being false is terminal, because the comparison Lambdas raise and the later flags never arrive.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="1328" width="600" height="86" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s16-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="16" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="1426" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s16-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notify on failure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;A face mismatch, a details mismatch, or a failed validation publishes to ApplicationNotifications (dashed). The email subscription only delivers once confirmed by hand.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="1424" width="600" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="legend-note" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);" value="Dashed arrows are failure or return paths. Steps 7-12 all happen inside one Step Functions execution (pink dashed lane). One HTTP API serves both audiences: /license is AWS_IAM, /api/* is Cognito JWT, and CORS plus the 5 req/s throttle are shared by all three routes. LicenseQueue redrives to LicenseDeadLetterQueue after maxReceiveCount = 3 at a 120s visibility timeout. The document bucket is encrypted with the customer-managed KMS key (red dashed line, bucket key enabled); objects in zipped/ and unzipped/ expire after 30 days. On the site bucket, a missing key returns 403 rather than 404 because the OAC policy omits s3:ListBucket - the distribution maps both to /404.html. Greyed boxes are not on the live request path: DocumentLambda is commented out in Terraform, and the custom-domain band below is not written at all." vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="1500" width="650" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="opt-b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;" value="+" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2204" y="1700" width="38" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="opt-d" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Optional - custom domain (not implemented)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The greyed band at the bottom of the canvas. Everything else here is deployed and proven end to end; the site simply answers on the distribution's default *.cloudfront.net name. Two services close the gap - a Route 53 hosted zone with an A alias to the distribution, and an ACM public certificate issued in us-east-1 (CloudFront reads certificates from that Region only, and this stack already deploys there). Then three edits: aliases on the distribution, viewer_certificate swapped to the ACM ARN with sni-only, and the new origin added to both CORS allow-lists, which today are derived from local.site_origin. That last one is the easy miss - it is not a new service, and without it the presigned PUT and every /api/* call fail preflight from the new domain.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2254" y="1698" width="600" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
